@startuml D-02-despliegue-docker
title D-02 · Despliegue Docker: 11 servicios y perfiles\n(docker-compose.yml · perfil https opcional)
scale max 1600 width

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam TitleFontSize 17
skinparam ArrowColor #244B5A
skinparam nodeBorderColor #244B5A
skinparam databaseBorderColor #244B5A
skinparam nodesep 24
skinparam ranksep 40

node "Host Linux con Docker Engine" as HOST {
  node "Proyecto de compose (nombre por defecto: sismo)" as PROY {
    node "Nodos ESP32 simulados\nDebian 12 · núcleo Raft real" as NODOS {
      node "nodo1\nsismo-nodo-1\nHTTP 8080 · UDP 4210" as N1
      node "nodo2\nsismo-nodo-2\nHTTP 8080 · UDP 4210" as N2
      node "nodo3\nsismo-nodo-3\nHTTP 8080 · UDP 4210" as N3
      N1 <--> N2 : "Raft UDP 4210"
      N2 <--> N3 : "Raft UDP 4210"
      N1 <--> N3 : "Raft UDP 4210"
    }
    node "Servidores de datos\nNode.js :8100" as SERV {
      node "servidor1\nFedora 42\nhost :8101" as S1
      node "servidor2\nopenSUSE Leap 15.6\nhost :8102" as S2
      node "servidor3\nUbuntu 24.04\nhost :8103" as S3
    }
    database "Bases PostgreSQL\npostgres:16-alpine" as DBS {
      database "db1\nvolumen sismo-db1" as DB1
      database "db2\nvolumen sismo-db2" as DB2
      database "db3\nvolumen sismo-db3" as DB3
    }
    node "panel\nnode:22-alpine\n:8090 → host :8095" as PANEL
    node "controlador\nnode:22-alpine · :8200\nsin puerto publicado\nread_only · cap_drop ALL" as CTRL
    node "https (perfil https)\ncaddy:2-alpine · :8443\ntls internal · reverse_proxy" as CADDY
  }
  node "Docker Engine\n/var/run/docker.sock" as DOCKER
}

S1 --> DB1 : "depends_on healthy"
S2 --> DB2 : "depends_on healthy"
S3 --> DB3 : "depends_on healthy"
S1 --> N1 : "HTTP :8080 · 1 Hz"
S2 --> N2 : "HTTP :8080 · 1 Hz"
S3 --> N3 : "HTTP :8080 · 1 Hz"
PANEL --> NODOS : "GET /estado /log\n/sucesos /alertas"
PANEL --> SERV : "GET /info /api/historial\nPOST /acciones"
PANEL --> CTRL : "Bearer CONTROL_TOKEN\nGET /estado · POST /servidores/{n}/{acción}"
CTRL --> DOCKER : "Engine API /v1.43\nsolo stop/start de nodoN y servidorN"
CTRL -[dashed]-> NODOS : "docker stop/start"
CTRL -[dashed]-> SERV : "docker stop/start"
CADDY --> PANEL : "reverse_proxy :8090"

note right of PROY
  Perfil por defecto (11 servicios):
  nodo1..3 + db1..3 + servidor1..3 + panel + controlador.
  El servicio https (Caddy) solo se crea con:
  docker compose --profile https up -d
  Las bases de datos no publican puerto.
end note

note bottom of CTRL
  Único servicio con el socket de Docker.
  Solo entiende GET /estado, GET /salud y
  POST /servidores/{1|2|3}/{apagar|encender};
  nunca para ni arranca dbN y no publica puerto.
end note

note top of CADDY
  ADMIN:   https://host:8443/admin/
  CLIENTE: https://host:8443/cliente/
  Certificado local (tls internal): /ca.crt.
end note

note bottom of PROY
  docker-compose.prod.yml (overlay de producción):
  - nodo1..3 pasan al perfil "simulados" (no arrancan);
  - servidores y bases usan secretos y no publican puertos;
  - controlador y panel usan CONTROL_TOKEN_FILE;
  - VYBRA_ENTORNO=produccion rechaza la clave de desarrollo.
end note

note bottom of PANEL
  URLs por defecto del stack:
  ADMIN   http://localhost:8095/admin/
  CLIENTE http://localhost:8095/publico
end note

@enduml
